; Forward, four cards a segment in (pc, kind, vls, te), four out: pte (the end filter of the segment before; 0 after
; a pause), prevv (the segment before that isn't a pause, if it is a vowel), pvls (the segment before is P T K) and
; pnpk (the kind of the segment before that isn't a pause).
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   pc       03-17: a segment, and what came before it
  04                    INP   kind
  05                    INP   vls
  06                    INP   te
  07                    OUT   pte
  08                    CLA   pnpk
  09                    SUB   00
  10                    TAC   no
  11                    SUB   00
  12                    TAC   yes
  13            no      OUT   z
  14                    JMP   o2
  15            yes     OUT   pnpc
  16            o2      OUT   pvls
  17                    OUT   pnpk
  18                    CLA   kind     18-33: this segment is the one before now
  19                    SUB   c8
  20                    TAC   snd
  21                    CLA   z
  22                    STO   pte
  23                    STO   pvls
  24                    JMP   rec
  25            snd     CLA   te
  26                    STO   pte
  27                    CLA   vls
  28                    STO   pvls
  29                    CLA   kind
  30                    STO   pnpk
  31                    CLA   pc
  32                    STO   pnpc
  33                    JMP   rec
  40            pc      DATA  0
  41            kind    DATA  0
  42            vls     DATA  0
  43            te      DATA  0
  44            pte     DATA  0
  45            pvls    DATA  0
  46            pnpk    DATA  0
  47            pnpc    DATA  0
  48            z       DATA  0
  49            c8      DATA  8
